{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着DDR5內存價格持續上漲，組裝一台新電腦的成本也隨之增加。不過，美國零售商Micro Center近日推出了一項頗具吸引力的硬件促銷活動：將AMD鋭龍7 7700X3D處理器、技嘉B650主板以及32GB DDR5內存組合銷售，原價954美元的套裝降至649美元，直接優惠304美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585502.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.587958+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T14:25:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"d7dc4f81b3862532e1bdca01e63f77f0b1e4bdc05e75570d55d57dd1c0ab5f9b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}